# The lines for the end of the Captain Burak fight, approved by the user, said before the fade to the Victory
# or Defeat screen. player_won: the player beat him. player_lost: he beat the player.

~ player_won
Captain Burak: Ow! Okay, okay... you've earned your stripes, kiddo.
Captain Burak: Welcome aboard, @member. Don't let it go to your head. That's my job.
=> END

~ player_lost
Captain Burak: Hah! Down with the ship, eh?
Captain Burak: The barrels were RIGHT THERE, kiddo. Think!
=> END
